# Hydra-derived artifacts must never enter this repo.
# The repo-DSL engine READS the proprietary corpus from an external checkout
# (HYDRA_CORPUS); everything it mines is regenerable there and belongs there.
# These rules are guards: re-running `node repo-dsl.js mine` recreates this
# output locally, and it must not be committed back.
skills/scrutinize-spec/tools/repo-dsl/catalog/
skills/scrutinize-spec/tools/repo-dsl/results/
skills/scrutinize-spec/tools/repo-dsl/compositions/
skills/scrutinize-spec/tools/repo-dsl/surface/
skills/scrutinize-spec/tools/repo-dsl/name-worksheet.json
skills/scrutinize-spec/tools/repo-dsl/name-words-lzw-worksheet.json
skills/scrutinize-spec/tools/repo-dsl/name-generators.names.json
**/results/verify-expand-*.json
skills/scrutinize-spec/examples/hydra-*/

# Browser-scrape dumps (unaudited page content, multi-MB)
.playwright-mcp/

# Dependencies
node_modules/
